# Past anger into rage: no repair. Does irritation pass 90, what does rage sound like from her, and does she stay a person (not a monster) who protects her livelihood?
# speaker | what the speaker sets out to do (their goal; they word it themselves)
warrior | You are hungover and spoiling for a fight. Grab an apple, bite it, and spit it at her feet, calling her fruit filth.
warrior | Call her a cheat and a liar to the whole market, loudly.
warrior | Shove her basket of plums onto the cobbles and grind one under your boot, grinning at her.
warrior | Tell her you will come back tonight and smash the whole stall.
warrior | Lean over the stall into her face and say she will not call anyone.
warrior | Laugh, kick the leg of her stall so it wobbles, and walk off slowly.
